---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '~/components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '~/components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — g8suite"
  description="How Developers Hub Sdn Bhd handles personal data on the g8suite marketing site."
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main" class="pt-24 lg:pt-28">
    <div class="container-page pb-24">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="py-5 text-sm text-faint">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-body">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="text-muted">Privacy</span>
      </nav>

      <header class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-body sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-faint">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <section>
          <p>
            This policy explains how <strong class="text-body">Developers Hub Sdn Bhd</strong> ("we", "us")
            handles personal data collected through this website (the g8suite marketing site). It applies to
            this site only, not to any product deployed inside a customer's own environment.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Information we collect</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brass"></span><span><strong class="text-body">Information you send us.</strong> When you email us or make an enquiry, we receive the details you choose to provide — such as your name, organisation, work email, and the content of your message.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brass"></span><span><strong class="text-body">Technical data.</strong> Standard information your browser sends when visiting any website, such as a truncated request, referrer, and approximate region — used only in aggregate to keep the site healthy.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            This site does not set advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. We use
            <strong class="text-body">Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong>, a privacy-first, cookieless
            measurement tool that reports aggregate traffic without fingerprinting visitors or building
            personal profiles.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">How we use information</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We use the information you send to respond to your enquiry, arrange demonstrations, and
            correspond about g8suite. We use aggregate technical data to operate, secure, and improve the
            site. We do not sell personal data, and we do not use it for automated decision-making.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Sharing</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We share personal data only with service providers that help us run this site and communicate
            with you — for example our hosting and analytics providers — and only to the extent needed for
            those purposes. We may disclose information where required by law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We keep enquiry correspondence for as long as needed to handle your request and for a reasonable
            period afterwards for our records, then delete or anonymise it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            You may ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal data you have provided, or to stop
            contacting you. To make a request, email
            <a href="mailto:hello@devhub.my" class="font-medium text-brass hover:underline">hello@devhub.my</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Security &amp; international transfers</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We take reasonable measures to protect information handled through this site. Some service
            providers may process data outside Malaysia; where they do, we rely on providers that offer
            appropriate safeguards.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Changes</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the "last
            updated" date above.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-body">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Developers Hub Sdn Bhd, Johor Bahru, Malaysia —
            <a href="mailto:hello@devhub.my" class="font-medium text-brass hover:underline">hello@devhub.my</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
